description":"一款强大易用的方程绘图工具","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Graphmatica 是一款功能强大且易于使用的方程绘图工具，具备数值计算与微积分功能：\n- 绘制笛卡尔函数、关系式及不等式，支持极坐标、参数方程和常微分方程。\n- 单屏最多可同时显示 999 个图形。\n- 提供数据绘图与曲线拟合功能。\n- 数值求解并可视化切线方程和积分结果。\n- 可查找临界点、方程解以及笛卡尔函数交点。\n- 支持黑白/彩色打印，或以位图/矢量格式复制到剪贴板，还可导出为 JPEG/PNG 文件。\n- 在线帮助和演示文件让您快速上手。\n总之，这是从高中代数到大学微积分课程中师生皆宜的绝佳工具。","tags":["公式","图形","微积分","数学","等式","绘图","计算器"]}},"publisherUrl":"http://www.graphmatica.com/","releaseDate":"2017-06-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"http://www.graphmatica.com/patch24.html","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/k/kSoft/Graphmatica/2.4.2.1/kSoft.Graphmatica.yaml","sha256":"e8feceadb44403413959c68d95a99aba4d5acdf0689bcb3c8ca4f44c9c659af9"},{"path":"manifests/k/kSoft/Graphmatica/2.4.2.1/kSoft.Graphmatica.installer.yaml","sha256":"4e00812d8f920377c1dbb015cb756dfd7ddb8fe553b36548092f97b804b3956f"},{"path":"manifests/k/kSoft/Graphmatica/2.4.2.1/kSoft.Graphmatica.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"951280359a5f88e1f49af3ecc9d22a01e455ec5ad8d371b98f0492bb05931b43"},{"path":"manifests/k/kSoft/Graphmatica/2.4.2.1/kSoft.Graphmatica.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"9a62359da56f0c9f7e04f437220c8c2af47f9361b0a6d229b4c47145614339dd"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"2.4.2.1"}